# Secrets and local state must never enter the image.
config.json
app/data/
.env
.env.*

node_modules/
.git/
.gitignore

# The single-file CTA and all planning docs — not part of the service.
index.html
teacher-dashboard.html
# Both patterns are needed. Docker's `*` does not cross a path separator, so
# `*.md` only ever matched the context root — app/README.md and app/gcp-setup.md
# were shipping inside the image until 2026-08-10. They are not served (static
# routing is scoped to app/web/), but app/README.md carries the demo password,
# both project ids, service-account names and the security-posture writeup, so
# it has no business in a production container. Verified by listing the built
# image, not by reading this file.
*.md
**/*.md
old/
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
*.log
